{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "int0g6qub677nbec", "title": "44.大模型灾难性遗忘的解决方案", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"83d4d33c\" id=\"83d4d33c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0f8da85\" id=\"ub0f8da85\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ue4866944\" id=\"ue4866944\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751699932205-a502174c-835f-4365-94bf-441db1094517.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uddc29d91-16a3-408a-94b5-fd90c5f9d42%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0776060b-30f9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A482.1333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A274%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A83127%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A904%2C%22originHeight%22%3A514%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%AD%A3%E5%88%99%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A689%2C%22y%22%3A235%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%22%2C%22x%22%3A355%2C%22y%22%3A396%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B7%B7%E5%90%88%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%22%2C%22x%22%3A689%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A152%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B8%90%E8%BF%9B%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%22%2C%22x%22%3A688%2C%22y%22%3A183%2C%22width%22%3A151%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%22%2C%22x%22%3A684%2C%22y%22%3A450%2C%22width%22%3A155%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E8%92%B8%E6%A6%B4%22%2C%22x%22%3A689%2C%22y%22%3A346%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A357%2C%22y%22%3A234%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E9%87%87%E6%A0%B7%22%2C%22x%22%3A687%2C%22y%22%3A122%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%AD%94%E9%A2%98%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A233%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A688%2C%22y%22%3A398%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A688%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PEFT%E5%BE%AE%E8%B0%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A684%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A155%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A356%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uecad8806%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf77b7c0a\" id=\"uf77b7c0a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a2b622f\" id=\"u5a2b622f\">灾难性遗忘（Catastrophic Forgetting）指大模型在微调过程中过度适应新任务数据，导致预训练阶段学到的通用知识严重退化的问题。解决方案需结合</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uac204ee5\" id=\"uac204ee5\">数据策略</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubb92a7d8\" id=\"ubb92a7d8\">、</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u06d093cb\" id=\"u06d093cb\">训练策略</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u720539f1\" id=\"u720539f1\">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc0011f53\" id=\"uc0011f53\">模型架构优化</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3ff515f2\" id=\"u3ff515f2\">三方面：</span></p><ol list=\"u0736b9cc\"><li fid=\"uf3c7ad19\" data-lake-id=\"u2aeb8f3a\" id=\"u2aeb8f3a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u21276dcd\" id=\"u21276dcd\">数据策略</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u42d41a83\" id=\"u42d41a83\">：混合通用与领域数据，控制数据比例；动态重采样。</span></li><li fid=\"uf3c7ad19\" data-lake-id=\"uc109600d\" id=\"uc109600d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uba35e8e2\" id=\"uba35e8e2\">训练策略</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u056efab2\" id=\"u056efab2\">：渐进式学习、正则化约束、参数高效微调（PEFT）。</span></li><li fid=\"uf3c7ad19\" data-lake-id=\"u3fa33a0f\" id=\"u3fa33a0f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucbe4b083\" id=\"ucbe4b083\">模型架构</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uecae1c98\" id=\"uecae1c98\">：知识蒸馏、模块化设计（如Adapter）。<br />以下结合真实项目案例分点解析。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uda469f8c\" id=\"uda469f8c\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"6c12541a\" id=\"6c12541a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1efb755f\" id=\"u1efb755f\">二、项目案例</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uf755e80b\" id=\"uf755e80b\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751699952254-3ce6a1e8-8b66-41b5-9190-15356503362a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub426cfeb-e5f7-462f-a0e6-472285f1e4d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0776060b-30f9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A467.73333333333335%2C%22height%22%3A185%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A55246%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A877%2C%22originHeight%22%3A346%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%94%B9%E8%BF%9B%22%2C%22x%22%3A682%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%9D%A2%E4%B8%B4%E6%8C%91%E6%88%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A688%2C%22y%22%3A119%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A353%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E5%BE%AE%E8%B0%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A687%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A686%2C%22y%22%3A181%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A354%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E8%AE%BE%E5%AE%9A%22%2C%22x%22%3A690%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A684%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua11bb1b8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"818499e9\" id=\"818499e9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u943908a9\" id=\"u943908a9\">案例背景：医疗问答大模型的领域微调</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u3a795367\" id=\"u3a795367\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u63af7bd7\" id=\"u63af7bd7\">目标</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue444a68c\" id=\"ue444a68c\">：在通用LLaMA-7B模型上微调，使其能专业回答心脑血管疾病问题，同时保留基础语言能力。<br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua26e7e73\" id=\"ua26e7e73\">挑战</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u58daa814\" id=\"u58daa814\">：微调后模型在通用数学推理任务上的准确率下降40%，且出现“非医疗问题胡言乱语”现象。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ewoEv%22%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"3782cc68\" id=\"3782cc68\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8cf10786\" id=\"u8cf10786\">解决方案与实施</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u3bd176fc\" id=\"u3bd176fc\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751700006982-2f873c62-489c-4d96-9434-c9118eb8401c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u7a28cd6b-97ee-4e87-8ad0-a71c45b68f2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0776060b-30f9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A494.4%2C%22height%22%3A262%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A81126%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A927%2C%22originHeight%22%3A492%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADAPTER%E8%AE%BE%22%2C%22x%22%3A666%2C%22y%22%3A390%2C%22width%22%3A158%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%88%86%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E8%AE%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A668%2C%22y%22%3A172%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%22%2C%22x%22%3A668%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E5%BE%AE%E8%B0%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A339%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A339%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%22%2C%22x%22%3A668%2C%22y%22%3A224%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A670%2C%22y%22%3A110%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LORA%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A669%2C%22y%22%3A337%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8A%BF%E4%BD%93%E7%8E%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A666%2C%22y%22%3A437%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%22%2C%22x%22%3A670%2C%22y%22%3A8%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A340%2C%22y%22%3A223%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BD%E7%BB%86%E8%8A%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A2%2C%22y%22%3A223%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%AD%A3%E5%88%99%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A668%2C%22y%22%3A276%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f8f8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u578a10cf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h5 data-lake-id=\"36a71af8\" id=\"36a71af8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4a8148a\" id=\"ue4a8148a\">1. </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u96544f67\" id=\"u96544f67\">数据策略：混合数据与动态采样</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u89d28e33\"><li fid=\"ub2411874\" data-lake-id=\"uae189206\" id=\"uae189206\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u17703733\" id=\"u17703733\">方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue20131e6\" id=\"ue20131e6\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u89d28e33\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ub2c7f2f4\" data-lake-id=\"u9b22c409\" id=\"u9b22c409\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4c01516b\" id=\"u4c01516b\">训练数据 = 15%通用数据（Wikipedia、Common Crawl） + 85%医疗数据（PubMed论文、患者QA记录）。</span></li><li fid=\"ub2c7f2f4\" data-lake-id=\"u6f15a603\" id=\"u6f15a603\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u905adb4a\" id=\"u905adb4a\">动态重采样</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u882729fb\" id=\"u882729fb\">：每轮训练增加通用数据比例（从15%→30%），避免模型早期过度偏向医疗数据。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u89d28e33\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"ub2411874\" data-lake-id=\"u34591ddc\" id=\"u34591ddc\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua2fee7d7\" id=\"ua2fee7d7\">工具</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc7552d4e\" id=\"uc7552d4e\">：使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u623ffca0\" id=\"u623ffca0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4ca69b6\" id=\"uf4ca69b6\">WeightedRandomSampler</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubb27e769\" id=\"ubb27e769\">在PyTorch中实现动态采样权重调整。</span></li><li fid=\"ub2411874\" data-lake-id=\"ua23ac48e\" id=\"ua23ac48e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u214a6b87\" id=\"u214a6b87\">效果</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufe14cba8\" id=\"ufe14cba8\">：通用任务准确率回升至92%（原95%），医疗任务精度保持89%。</span></li></ul><h5 data-lake-id=\"19ee5885\" id=\"19ee5885\"><span data-lake-id=\"u74523c1e\" id=\"u74523c1e\">2. </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2f126298\" id=\"u2f126298\">训练策略：渐进学习与正则化约束</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u5a4d8ce6\"><li fid=\"uac2dbd72\" data-lake-id=\"u39d2ebbc\" id=\"u39d2ebbc\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7e94fe17\" id=\"u7e94fe17\">渐进式学习（Incremental Learning）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uef839793\" id=\"uef839793\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u5a4d8ce6\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u17ffb4d4\" data-lake-id=\"u5327e729\" id=\"u5327e729\"><span data-lake-id=\"u580b28dd\" id=\"u580b28dd\">分阶段训练： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u5a4d8ce6\" data-lake-indent=\"2\"><li fid=\"u181a26c0\" data-lake-id=\"u29ae6f44\" id=\"u29ae6f44\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ueac3d2f8\" id=\"ueac3d2f8\">阶段1</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u59916e1d\" id=\"u59916e1d\">：冻结Transformer前6层，仅微调最后2层+分类头（适配医疗术语）。</span></li><li fid=\"u181a26c0\" data-lake-id=\"u95294fe8\" id=\"u95294fe8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3014d90a\" id=\"u3014d90a\">阶段2</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc1583698\" id=\"uc1583698\">：解冻全部层，用低学习率（</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua337dcd6\" id=\"ua337dcd6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u780c8cd2\" id=\"u780c8cd2\">5e-6</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubfa8c1c6\" id=\"ubfa8c1c6\">）微调，避免大幅扰动预训练参数。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u5a4d8ce6\" start=\"2\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u17ffb4d4\" data-lake-id=\"uc12fae1c\" id=\"uc12fae1c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u60577927\" id=\"u60577927\">优化器选择</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uffd3483b\" id=\"uffd3483b\">：采用AdamW（</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub1ad29d2\" id=\"ub1ad29d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b946798\" id=\"u3b946798\">weight_decay=0.01</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udbc8e773\" id=\"udbc8e773\">）抑制参数突变。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u5a4d8ce6\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"uac2dbd72\" data-lake-id=\"u8285620a\" id=\"u8285620a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2ed0c406\" id=\"u2ed0c406\">正则化技术</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u170f3a3b\" id=\"u170f3a3b\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u5a4d8ce6\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u6eb9dd8c\" data-lake-id=\"u2521ebd7\" id=\"u2521ebd7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6ea8753f\" id=\"u6ea8753f\">EWC（Elastic Weight Consolidation）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3a4adf9f\" id=\"u3a4adf9f\">：计算预训练参数的Fisher信息矩阵，惩罚关键参数变动： </span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22loss%20%2B%3D%20lambda%20*%20%E2%88%91(F_i%20*%20(%CE%B8_i%20-%20%CE%B8_old_i)%5E2)%20%20%23%20F_i%E4%B8%BA%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E6%80%A7%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nrpWV%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u5a4d8ce6\" start=\"2\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u6eb9dd8c\" data-lake-id=\"u1b95409f\" id=\"u1b95409f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u983b19dc\" id=\"u983b19dc\">结果</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue6de5bc3\" id=\"ue6de5bc3\">：模型在GLUE基准测试中遗忘率降低60%。</span></li></ul><h5 data-lake-id=\"3349fa53\" id=\"3349fa53\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca27fd74\" id=\"uca27fd74\">3. </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u12b9d470\" id=\"u12b9d470\">参数高效微调（PEFT）</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u53fed049\"><li fid=\"u944cc371\" data-lake-id=\"uf355de7d\" id=\"uf355de7d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub0d6c440\" id=\"ub0d6c440\">LoRA（Low-Rank Adaptation）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u65a90196\" id=\"u65a90196\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u53fed049\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ub80138e7\" data-lake-id=\"u45c8fbf0\" id=\"u45c8fbf0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5f318e1\" id=\"ue5f318e1\">仅注入低秩矩阵（秩=8），原始参数冻结。</span></li><li fid=\"ub80138e7\" data-lake-id=\"uab013971\" id=\"uab013971\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a839d3c\" id=\"u4a839d3c\">代码实现（Hugging 