e-id=\"uf33e0bfa\" id=\"uf33e0bfa\">引入EWC正则化，惩罚关键参数变动（如位置编码矩阵）。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u08b5349e\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"ufb467bef\" data-lake-id=\"u53704b57\" id=\"u53704b57\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6df5cda8\" id=\"u6df5cda8\">架构层面</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u88142480\" id=\"u88142480\">： </span></li></ol><ul list=\"u9251b26d\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u6dcef70b\" data-lake-id=\"ufb7b1313\" id=\"ufb7b1313\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec3a4d24\" id=\"uec3a4d24\">用LoRA注入低秩矩阵（秩=8），原始参数冻结率99%，显存降低70%。</span></li><li fid=\"u6dcef70b\" data-lake-id=\"u06c4c11e\" id=\"u06c4c11e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u624f8fba\" id=\"u624f8fba\">添加Adapter模块隔离领域知识，避免污染通用表示空间。<br />结果：医疗QA准确率89%，通用任务精度仅下降3%（对照组下降40%）。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u6ba5dc69\" id=\"u6ba5dc69\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u87c21720\" id=\"u87c21720\">关键教训</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc731b1a6\" id=\"uc731b1a6\">：灾难性遗忘本质是“知识冲突”，需在数据、训练、架构三环节协同约束参数漂移。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nP9lr%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"2d325051\" id=\"2d325051\"><span data-lake-id=\"u754332f1\" id=\"u754332f1\">四、总结</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u91f9f4bc\" id=\"u91f9f4bc\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751700041144-c408a626-b8ad-4ad7-8617-7f92e6cb17be.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6c9f827c-bb98-4ee9-a204-134a9743b25%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0776060b-30f9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A475.73333333333335%2C%22height%22%3A181%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A55226%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A892%2C%22originHeight%22%3A340%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A685%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A155%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7